    {
        "content": "<p>I see there are plans for a <a href=\"https://github.com/cajal-technologies/talos/blob/main/IirisMigration.md\">migration to Iris</a>. Note that this is not a problem as far as <code>vcgen</code> compatibility is concerned; separation logics and frame inference will be supported by <code>vcgen</code> as well. (It's likely you'll need to wait for 4.36 to usefully apply it, though.) Since Iris is a framework for constructing (program logics on) separation logics and not <strong>a</strong> separation logic, I cannot promise that any obscure Iris instance will work seamlessly with <code>vcgen</code>, but I'm very optimistic that the particular instance that Talos uses will be.</p>",
        "id": 626227008,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Graf",
        "timestamp": 1790146204
    }
]